 701+ 8BE3 28 05            JR Z, .running
 702+ 8BE5 DD 36 02 02      LD (IX+ENT_STATE), STATE_FIGHTING
 703+ 8BE9 C9               RET
 704+ 8BEA
 705+ 8BEA              .running:
 706+ 8BEA DD 36 02 01      LD (IX+ENT_STATE), STATE_RUNNING
 707+ 8BEE C9               RET
